-- response checks
http: GET /status/100: invalid response: status 100 is not from 200 to 999 (1xx responses are not supported)
status 100: HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error
http: GET /status/101: invalid response: status 101 is not from 200 to 999 (1xx responses are not supported)
status 101: HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error
http: GET /status/199: invalid response: status 199 is not from 200 to 999 (1xx responses are not supported)
status 199: HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error
status 200: HTTP/1.1 200 OK
status 999: HTTP/1.1 999 Unknown
http: GET /name/space: invalid response: header name "X Y" is not an HTTP token
header name space: HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error
http: GET /name/trailing: invalid response: header name "Transfer-Encoding " is not an HTTP token
header name trailing: HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error
http: GET /name/colon: invalid response: header name "X:Y" is not an HTTP token
header name colon: HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error
http: GET /name/empty: invalid response: header name "" is not an HTTP token
header name empty: HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error
header name symbols: HTTP/1.1 200 OK
